# 📌 API Documentation

### Base URL
`http://localhost:8000/api/v1`

---

## 1️⃣ USER SIGNUP

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/signup`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "role": "user"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "user": { ... },
  "accessToken": "eyJhb..."
}
```

---

## 2️⃣ USER LOGIN

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/login`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "user": { ... },
  "accessToken": "eyJhb..."
}
```

---

## 3️⃣ SEND OTP (For Registration)

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/send-otp`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@gmail.com"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "OTP sent successfully"
}
```

---

## 4️⃣ VERIFY OTP

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/verify-otp`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}
```

---

## 5️⃣ FORGOT PASSWORD

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/forgot-password`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@gmail.com"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "OTP has been generated successfully."
}
```

---

## 6️⃣ RESET PASSWORD

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/reset-password`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Password reset successfully"
}
```

---

## 7️⃣ CHANGE PASSWORD

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/change-password`  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "currentPassword": "OldPassword123",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword456"
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Password changed successfully"
}
```

---

## 8️⃣ GET USER PROFILE

**Method:** `GET`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/users/profile`  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "user": {
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "user@gmail.com",
    "skills": []
  }
}
```

---

## 9️⃣ UPDATE SKILLS

**Method:** `PATCH`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/users/skills`  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "skills": ["React", "Node.js"]
}
```

---

## 🔟 SAVE OPPORTUNITY

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/users/save/:opportunityId` *(Replace `:opportunityId` with actual ID)*  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

---

## 1️⃣1️⃣ GET ALL OPPORTUNITIES

**Method:** `GET`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/opportunities`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

**Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
       "title": "Software Engineer",
       "organization": "Tech Corp"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## 1️⃣2️⃣ GET OPPORTUNITY BY ID

**Method:** `GET`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/opportunities/:id` *(Replace `:id` with actual ID)*  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

---

## 1️⃣3️⃣ GET RECOMMENDED OPPORTUNITIES

**Method:** `GET`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/opportunities/recommendations`  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

---

## 1️⃣4️⃣ CREATE OPPORTUNITY

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/opportunities`  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

**Body:**
```json
{
  "title": "Frontend Developer",
  "description": "Looking for a React developer...",
  "organization": "Tech Corp",
  "category": "Engineering",
  "skillsRequired": ["React", "JavaScript"],
  "location": "Remote",
  "deadline": "2024-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
  "applicationLink": "https://example.com/apply"
}
```

---

## 1️⃣5️⃣ APPLY TO OPPORTUNITY

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/opportunities/:id/apply` *(Replace `:id` with actual Opportunity ID)*  
**Auth Required:** ✅ YES (Pass Bearer Token in Headers)  

---

## 1️⃣6️⃣ GENERATE AI RECOMMENDATIONS

**Method:** `POST`  
**Endpoint:** `/api/v1/recommendations/recommend`  
**Auth Required:** ❌ No  

